<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 73.2552 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 73.2552 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 73.2552 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday from 73.0887 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    5		    4</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.2552		 73.0887</p>
<p>    volume ($ mln)	     5.515		   3.290</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.3250		 47.3057</p>
<p>    volume (DM mln)	    0.040		   0.035</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom + 8 3272 509410</p>
